            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63052937?u=09a5e0d94acdfa2a81ccc582f904115c6f211b04&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A redo of <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/575237\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/575237/hovercard\">this pr</a> which was accidentally merged. I made this pr since it seems to be quite nix specific and would be nice for people to have, the diff itself seems quite stable since it hasnt needed to be updated once since it was <a href=\"https://github.com/NotAShelf/nyxexprs/blob/main/pkgs/btop/patches/normalize_processes.patch\">made</a> but I understand the points you made in the previous pr.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add an optional nix override for a popular btop patch that allows you to hide the /nix/store/hash- for your processes to improve readability.<br>\nwithout:<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/63052937/676655889-e2fbad38-5d69-45fb-a66c-faec31808daf.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..JZaQvdz3d2pyWMeKMlYh3Zj1COmzFbkI106D2BmhBJs\"><img width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/63052937/676655889-e2fbad38-5d69-45fb-a66c-faec31808daf.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..JZaQvdz3d2pyWMeKMlYh3Zj1COmzFbkI106D2BmhBJs\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 720px;; aspect-ratio: 1279 / 720; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">with:<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/63052937/676655794-fda82ed1-6df8-48f5-b70c-e433efcd8cfd.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..vNjByGgS2QBSdm5npHy623czNubhEgQsDdGcNZWAVj4\"><img width=\"1277\" height=\"722\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/63052937/676655794-fda82ed1-6df8-48f5-b70c-e433efcd8cfd.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..vNjByGgS2QBSdm5npHy623czNubhEgQsDdGcNZWAVj4\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 722px;; aspect-ratio: 1277 / 722; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a></p>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#automationai-policy\">automation/AI policy</a>.</li>\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested, as applicable:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Basic functionality of all binary files, usually in <code class=\"notranslate\">./result/bin/</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Ran <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> on this PR. See <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review#usage\">nixpkgs-review usage</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#package-tests\">Package tests</a> at <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS tests</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tests in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/lib/tests\">lib/tests</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/test\">pkgs/test</a> for functions and \"core\" functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Nixpkgs Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Package update: when the change is major or breaking.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>NixOS Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module addition: when adding a new NixOS module.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module update: when the change is significant.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
